A file-backed API tag listing returns complete tag records.

========== API ==========

tags({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
tag Imported
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Opening
  ; Imported: yes
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "tag": "Imported",
    "used": true
  }
]
